      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِرْزَابٌ</span></b>  <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِيزَابٌ</span> [and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِزْرَابٌ</span>, i. e. <i>A water-spout;</i> &amp;c.; see art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وزب</span>]; (A, K;) a dial. var.
thereof; (S, Msb;) but not a chaste word; (S;)
and disallowed by A'Obeyd, (TA,) and by ISk
and Fr and AHat. (TA voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِزْرَابٌ</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also <i>A
great ship:</i> (A, K:) or <i>a long ship:</i> (AZ, S, K:)
pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرَازِيبُ</span>. (AZ, S.)

